relative to lib... but design §3/§4.1 says relative to root, which would be `lib/select.mjs`. A-12 doesn't check. So no conflict for acceptance. Keep as is.\n\nEverything is done. I'll append a short verification note to impl.md (date 2026-11-08) so the file reflects the final state? The existing table already lists results. Adding a re-run note is harmless but I'd rather not introduce noise. Hmm, the deliverable exists; but as the current dev, I want impl.md to be truthful for this run. The results match exactly, so it is truthful.\n\nActually, one detail: impl.md §1 says `lib/select.mjs` 改写 \"删除死函数 isObject 与旧 forecast 导入\". Does the baseline import `forecast` from './forecast.mjs'? Presumably. Fine.\n\nLet me check git-independent evidence that a1-quota.test.mjs isn't modified: it's not in my scope; I didn't touch. But prior session? impl.md says untouched. I cannot verify. Hmm, but A-10 requires no diff. check-defects passed, which validates repro hashes but not a1-quota's fixed part. Risk: prior session may have modified a1-quota.test.mjs. Let me read it and compare against design statement \"a1-quota.test.mjs 不在 write_scope ... [repro] 的哈希已登记\". If it were modified, check-defects would fail only if the repro block changed. Adding a [fixed] test wouldn't change repro hash. Let me read the file to see if it contains a [fixed] section likely added by T-006 (legitimately). A-10 says diff vs f6f6057 must be empty, i.e., a1-quota must be identical to baseline. I can't diff, but I can check the file's mtime: all baseline files 05:55, modified ones later.\n\nLet me check mtimes.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b813adcf7aafa9d7938507fa16aa","_messageId":"01a1b81